# Cloudflare Workers assets exclusion list.
#
# wrangler.jsonc sets assets.directory to "." (the repo root), so WITHOUT this
# file every file in the repository is published to withsavvy.ai. That leaked
# dashboard.html (a working admin console, including the private admin API map)
# and docs/signup-architecture-proposal.md (trial-abuse and coupon-abuse detail)
# to the public internet with no authentication.
#
# Syntax follows .gitignore. Anything listed here is NOT uploaded.
#
# ADDING A NEW FILE AT THE REPO ROOT? It is published by default. If it is not
# part of the public marketing site, add it here in the same change.
#
# Deliberately still published: index.html, index-1.html, index-2.html,
# index3.html, privacy.html, Assets/, robots.txt, sitemap.xml, .nojekyll.
# (The stale index-* variants are handled separately by the banked noindex
# order — they are intentionally left published here.)

# --- The leak this file exists to close ---
dashboard.html
docs/

# --- Repo/tooling metadata, never part of the site ---
.assetsignore
.claude/
.github/
.gitignore
.pr_agent.toml
AGENTS.md
ANALYTICS.md
README.md
pr_compliance_checklist.yaml
wrangler.jsonc

# --- Build/runtime artifacts that must never ship ---
node_modules/
.wrangler/
.dev.vars*
.env
*.log
.worktrees/
backend/
data/
